# App preview videos scaffold (15-30s)
#
# - iOS App Preview: H.264, 30fps max, per-device-size .mov / .mp4
#   - 6.7" / 6.1" / 12.9" each accept up to 3 previews
# - Android promo video: YouTube URL only (Play Console accepts a YouTube link
#   in Main store listing → Promo video). The `mp4`/`mov` files in this dir
#   serve as the source uploads to YouTube.
#
# Naming convention:
#   ios-6.7-{n}.mov     ios-6.1-{n}.mov     ios-12.9-{n}.mov
#   android-promo.mp4
